From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:57:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix template/status/overwrite bugs; clean up repo

- Treat prototype keys (e.g. {{constructor}}) as unknown template fields; extract fill logic to lib/template.ts with tests
- Ask for confirmation before Magistrat data overwrites manual field edits
- Map upstream 5xx/other statuses to 502 in /api/companybook
- Remove zips, duplicated firmi-app-updated and magistrat-update bundle (already applied), .idea, tsbuildinfo, main.py
- Add root .gitignore; fix package name, drop bogus main/directories, add npm test script
